(AZUL - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players draft colored tiles and use them to decorate the wall of a palace. Points come) Tj T*
(from placing tiles next to each other and from completing rows, columns and colors.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Use 5 factory displays with 2 players, 7 with 3 players and 9 with 4 players. Fill) Tj T*
(each display with 4 random tiles from the bag. The first player marker goes in the) Tj T*
(center of the table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PHASE 1: FACTORY OFFER) Tj T*
(On your turn, either:) Tj T*
(- take all tiles of one color from one factory display and push the rest to the) Tj T*
(   center, or) Tj T*
(- take all tiles of one color from the center. The first player to take from the) Tj T*
(   center also) Tj T*
(takes the first player marker and puts it on their floor line. Then place the tiles on) Tj T*
(one of your 5 pattern lines \(they hold 1 to 5 tiles\). A pattern line may hold only one) Tj T*
(color, and not a color already placed in the matching row of your wall. Tiles that do) Tj T*
(not fit go to your floor line. The phase ends when all displays and the center are) Tj T*
(empty.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
