(PHASE 2: WALL TILING) Tj T*
(For each complete pattern line, move one tile to the matching color space of the same) Tj T*
(wall row and score it immediately; the other tiles of that line go to the box lid.) Tj T*
(- A tile with no neighbours scores 1 point.) Tj T*
(- Otherwise count the tiles connected horizontally \(including itself\) and the tiles) Tj T*
(   connected) Tj T*
(vertically \(including itself\) and add both numbers. Incomplete pattern lines stay for) Tj T*
(the next round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FLOOR LINE) Tj T*
(Each tile on the floor line loses points: -1, -1, -2, -2, -2, -3, -3. Your score can) Tj T*
(not drop below 0. The player with the first player marker starts the next round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends after the round in which at least one player completes a horizontal row) Tj T*
(of 5 tiles. End bonuses: 2 points per complete row, 7 points per complete column and) Tj T*
(10 points for each color that has all 5 tiles on the wall. The most points wins; on a) Tj T*
(tie, the most complete rows wins.) Tj T*
ET
